safechecker-plugin/theories/Extraction.v	EXTRACT_CONSTANT	TemplateToPCUICShared.memo_trans	"Trans_memo.memo"	trusted	[Trans_memo.memo s t k] returns [k ()]. With a test hook armed it instead raises the user error "trans_memo test"; it never returns another value. Checked by test-suite/trans_memo_contract.v.
